{"4663630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hollow Descent", "steam_appid": 4663630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your party and embark on a fantasy adventure where every decision can change the fate of the world… and those who travel beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1024 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/449856dc27c3190ae6006eb77c696212.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple characters with their own backgrounds, motivations and personal conflicts as you investigate an anomaly capable of transforming reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cities, dungeons and unknown territories while a strange corruption begins to spread across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, make difficult decisions and build relationships that will shape the story, the fate of your allies and the course of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters will change. Others will disappear. And not everyone will survive your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/b3df178805160f6ffb49c10a9d523d4a.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1024 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/b3df178805160f6ffb49c10a9d523d4a.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/b3df178805160f6ffb49c10a9d523d4a.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/62e64aa0dce7eee3accc7eab962c9dbb.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finn</strong>: A curious and impulsive young thief whose desire to uncover the unknown often leads him further than he should go. Raised in the Green Fields orphanage, Finn carries memories… and a secret that was never revealed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kael</strong>: A brutal and solitary warrior who lives by a single law: strength. He follows the law of fang and blood without hesitation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linto</strong>: A protector marked by a forbidden love and an oath impossible to break. Exiled for loving the wrong person, he now walks beneath his own banner, defending the weak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaleb</strong>: A devoted follower haunted by an ancient truth that threatens to consume him. A faithful worshipper of the Comet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1024 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/86de06af1c276849df49b7f06763633c.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative inspired by tabletop RPG campaigns</strong>, with a strong focus on choices and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> with unique abilities and personal story arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> cities, dungeons and territories affected by the anomaly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong> with strategic options and party management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main and side quests</strong> that influence the story and character relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful decisions</strong> that alter dialogues, character availability and multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original art and music</strong> inspired by classic fantasy RPGs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fantasy world shaped by secrets</strong>, corruption and supernatural phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/ad3dd4497c95e65404fddc6d757e634d.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, a green sphere descended upon the continent of <strong>Baedrish</strong>. Soon after, a mysterious fog known as The <strong>Black Storm</strong> began to consume cities and distort reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a new sphere has fallen in <strong>Escia</strong>… and history threatens to repeat itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hollow Descent</strong>, you will journey through <strong>Ganides</strong>, a land sustained by ancient core crystals, where the spread of The <strong>Black Storm</strong> threatens to shatter the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/e9d0e00bf41c27d993af44301265e302.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/e9d0e00bf41c27d993af44301265e302.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/e9d0e00bf41c27d993af44301265e302.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/457f405f930b4ad5539318e0f453de23.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free demo featuring the first hour of the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 includes 4–6 hours of story content, decisions and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full campaign will be released episodically, with an estimated total length of 50 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions may affect characters, events and future chapters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As The Black Storm spreads, reality itself begins to distort… and some will not be able to resist entering it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of Ganides will depend on your choices</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your party and embark on a fantasy adventure where every decision can change the fate of the world… and those who travel beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1024 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/1ae64146e8ae3b741bec14d70965b6bc.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/449856dc27c3190ae6006eb77c696212.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple characters with their own backgrounds, motivations and personal conflicts as you investigate an anomaly capable of transforming reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cities, dungeons and unknown territories while a strange corruption begins to spread across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap