son, he now walks beneath his own banner, defending the weak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaleb</strong>: A devoted follower haunted by an ancient truth that threatens to consume him. A faithful worshipper of the Comet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.poster.avif?t=1787400150\" width=1024 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.webm?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/7707dfed03e916f99c6b541dba5d5d1d.mp4?t=1787400150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663630/extras/86de06af1c276849df49b7f06763633c.avif?t=1787400150\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative inspired by tabletop RPG campaigns</strong>, with a strong focus on choices and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong> with unique abilities and personal story arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> cities, dungeons and territories affected by the anomaly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong> with strategic options and party management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main and side quests</strong> that influence the story and character relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful decisions</strong> that a